":"Walk in the Adamello Brenta park","type":"trail","detail":"The Brenta dolomites start here, with meadow and wood paths at the bottom and a UNESCO listed range above.","season":[6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":10,"urls":["https://www.dolomiti.it/en/comano-terme","https://www.trentino.com/en/trentino/dolomiti-di-brenta-terme-di-comano/comano-terme/","https://www.komoot.com/guide/548990/cosa-da-vedere-e-attrazioni-nei-dintorni-di-comano-terme"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Lake Toblino and Lake Tenno","type":"activity","detail":"Two very different lakes within half an hour: a castle standing in the water at Toblino, and Tenno's improbable turquoise up in the hills.","season":[5,6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":10,"urls":["https://www.dolomiti.it/en/comano-terme","https://www.komoot.com/guide/548990/cosa-da-vedere-e-attrazioni-nei-dintorni-di-comano-terme","https://ecobnb.com/blog/2021/08/comano-terme-trentino/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Monte Casale viewpoint","type":"activity","detail":"The panoramic road climbs to a summit that shows you six lakes at once, with the Brenta and Adamello Presanella groups behind them.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":10,"urls":["https://www.dolomiti.it/en/comano-terme","https://www.komoot.com/guide/548990/cosa-da-vedere-e-attrazioni-nei-dintorni-di-comano-terme","https://ecobnb.com/blog/2021/08/comano-terme-trentino/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Stenico Castle","type":"activity","detail":"A manor castle above the valley with 13th century frescoes still on the walls.","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":10,"urls":["https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g673480-Activities-Ponte_Arche_Comano_Terme_Province_of_Trento_Trentino_Alto_Adige.html","https://www.komoot.com/guide/548990/cosa-da-vedere-e-attrazioni-nei-dintorni-di-comano-terme","https://www.trentino.com/en/trentino/dolomiti-di-brenta-terme-di-comano/comano-terme/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Fiave pile